  "details": "Apple device and iOS version:\n\nIPhone 14 on Version 17.5.1\n\nInstalled VRC Testflight Version and VRC Build Number\n\n2024.2.3 (333) and VRC Build 1472\n\nDescription of the Issue:\n\nThe \"Open Logs Folder\" button in the Debug section of the main menu does nothing\n\nSteps I took:\n\nWent into a world to open the main menu, scrolled down till I got to \"Debug\" opened that clicked on \"Open Logs Folder\" under \"Debug\"\n\nWhat do you expect to happen?\n\nIt would open the Apple Files App and direct itself to the \"VRChat β\" folder\n\nWhat happens instead?\n\nNothing",
